 "scratch": "原题2步 → 新题4步。设计情境：班级买奖品，两种物品混合购买，涉及小数乘整数求总价，以及带括号的加减混合运算求剩余预算。数据：笔记本3.5元/本买6本，钢笔4.8元/支买5本，总预算100元。计算：3.5*6=21, 4.8*5=24, 21+24=45, 100-45=55。",
 "solver_code": "from decimal import Decimal\ndef solve():\n    price_notebook = Decimal('3.5')\n    count_notebook = 6\n    price_pen = Decimal('4.8')\n    count_pen = 5\n    total_budget = Decimal('100')\n    \n    cost_notebooks = price_notebook * count_notebook\n    cost_pens = price_pen * count_pen\n    total_cost = cost_notebooks + cost_pens\n    change = total_budget - total_cost\n    \n    return [change]",
 "figure": null,
 "stem": "四年级一班准备用 $100$ 元班费购买奖品。他们买了 $6$ 本笔记本，每本 $3.5$ 元；又买了 $5$ 支钢笔，每支 $4.8$ 元。买完这些奖品后，班费还剩多少元？",
 "options": [],
